<div class="stonetop-playbook-picker-body">
	<div class="stonetop-playbook-picker-intro">
		<p>Your <strong>playbook</strong> is who your hero is in Stonetop: their role in the village, their strengths, and the special moves they bring to the table. There's no wrong pick, so choose whatever sparks your imagination.</p>
		<p>Hover over any card for a short description and a sense of how complex it is to play. New to the village? The <strong>Setting Overview</strong> button sketches Stonetop and the world around it.</p>
	</div>
	<div class="stonetop-playbook-picker-topbar">
		<button type="button" class="stonetop-playbook-picker-setting-overview">Setting Overview</button>
	</div>
	<div class="stonetop-playbook-picker-grid">
		{{#each playbooks}}
		<button type="button"
			class="stonetop-playbook-picker-card stonetop-playbook-picker-card--{{this.slug}}{{#if taken}} is-taken{{/if}}"
			data-uuid="{{this.uuid}}"
			data-complexity="{{this.complexity}}"
			data-description="{{this.description}}"
		>
			{{#if img}}
			<img class="stonetop-playbook-picker-card-icon" src="{{this.img}}" alt="">
			{{/if}}
			<span class="stonetop-playbook-picker-card-name">{{this.name}}</span>
			{{!-- Flagged, never blocked: "No doubling up" (Book I p.49) is the table's to waive. --}}
			{{#if takenBy}}
			<span class="stonetop-playbook-picker-card-holders">{{this.takenBy}}</span>
			{{/if}}
			{{#if deadHolders}}
			<span class="stonetop-playbook-picker-card-holders stonetop-playbook-picker-card-holders--dead">{{this.deadHolders}}</span>
			{{/if}}
		</button>
		{{/each}}
	</div>
	{{#unless playbooks.length}}
	{{!-- The playbooks come from the system's items compendium; with it missing the grid is empty. --}}
	<p class="stonetop-playbook-picker-empty">No playbooks to choose from: this world can't find the Stonetop items compendium. Ask your GM to check that the Stonetop system is installed and enabled correctly, then try again.</p>
	{{/unless}}
</div>
